==Usage== <nowiki>{{uploadlink|file}}</nowiki> <nowiki>{{uploadlink|file|link text}}</nowiki> <nowiki>{{uploadlink|file|reupload=yes}}</nowiki> <nowiki>{{uploadlink|file|link text|reupload=yes}}</nowiki>
Setting <tt>reupload</tt> to <tt>yes</tt> indicates there is a file there and this link should be for uploading a new version. You should verify the file exists before using this form. {{doc/end}}

